WEBVTT

00:01:29.263 --> 00:01:31.575
ljudi su naseljavali oblasti na Arktiku

00:01:31.575 --> 00:01:33.804
hiljadama godina.

00:01:33.804 --> 00:01:37.483
U život na Arktiku spadaju i
organizmi koji žive u ledu,

00:01:37.483 --> 00:01:39.456
zooplankton i fitoplankton,

00:01:39.456 --> 00:01:41.041
ribe i morski sisari,

00:01:41.041 --> 00:01:41.730
ptice,

00:01:41.730 --> 00:01:42.597
kopnene životinje,

00:01:42.597 --> 00:01:42.985
biljke

00:01:42.985 --> 00:01:45.084
i ljudska društva.

00:01:45.084 --> 00:01:47.183
Dobro, a Antarktik?

00:01:47.183 --> 00:01:50.224
Antarktik je najjužniji kontinent

00:01:50.224 --> 00:01:52.885
na kome se nalazi geografski Južni pol.

00:01:52.885 --> 00:01:55.588
To je peti najveći kontinent na planeti,

00:01:55.588 --> 00:01:57.836
skoro dvaput veći od Australije.

00:01:57.836 --> 00:02:01.335
Skoro 98% Antarktika je prekriveno ledom